{"3101780": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starless Umbra", "steam_appid": 3101780, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/2fb8709afaf09343119f36798af6ebf8.apng?t=1787966924\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/2fb8709afaf09343119f36798af6ebf8.poster.avif?t=1787966924\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Story Header\" width=616 height=56 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Amalia as she searches for her friend in a land afflicted by a noxious fog. The deeper she ventures, the further she unravels a force that threatens far more than just one life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/04461c8a25ce6d8a82da5d2714a21c51.poster.avif?t=1787966924\" aria-label=\"battling on a train\" width=780 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/04461c8a25ce6d8a82da5d2714a21c51.webm?t=1787966924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/04461c8a25ce6d8a82da5d2714a21c51.mp4?t=1787966924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/80de2dd7e44b460f7e8e2033d5ab141f.poster.avif?t=1787966924\" aria-label=\"Features Header\" width=616 height=56 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/80de2dd7e44b460f7e8e2033d5ab141f.webm?t=1787966924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Real-time combat</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Start battles as you approach enemies on the field</strong> in a real-time battle system. No random encounters, no turns.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose from skills that encourage rapid resource management and clever positioning</strong>. HP replenishes after battle if your party is in good spirits.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manipulate enemy focus (aggro)</strong>, encourage teammates, and master skill rotations in a system inspired by MMORPGs and action RPGs.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Play with friends</strong> (couch co-op) for even more chaos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/12dcc0a74557dc73de85f89122928b88.poster.avif?t=1787966924\" aria-label=\"exploring the world\" width=780 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/12dcc0a74557dc73de85f89122928b88.webm?t=1787966924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/12dcc0a74557dc73de85f89122928b88.mp4?t=1787966924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Plenty of character customization</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Select abilities and enhance them with augments</strong>, discoverable gems that change how skills behave.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Learn passive abilities from equipment</strong>, such as combat-start buffs or bonuses when allies fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine skills</strong> to create devastating combos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/214fd325f442a50e229d2871e961c97a.poster.avif?t=1787966924\" aria-label=\"traveling through a desert\" width=780 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/214fd325f442a50e229d2871e961c97a.webm?t=1787966924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/214fd325f442a50e229d2871e961c97a.mp4?t=1787966924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A focus on fun</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15–25 hour story</strong> focused on grounded relationships in a deadly fog-plagued world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay variety</strong>: minigames, puzzles, and quests; performance affects difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encouraged item usage</strong>; refill empty bottles in towns instead of hoarding.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/ca785acff4e7107ad322d879cff6938e.apng?t=1787966924\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/ca785acff4e7107ad322d879cff6938e.poster.avif?t=1787966924\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Team Header\" width=616 height=56 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project was built over 20 years through multiple engines, story rewrites, and with the help of a patient, supportive community.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>zexyu</strong> - Story, engineering, graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SaKo</strong> - Character portraits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>puking rabbit</strong> - Monster sprites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Pipasdefranilla</strong> - Character sprites</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Brandon McKagan</strong> - Music</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/2fb8709afaf09343119f36798af6ebf8.apng?t=1787966924\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/2fb8709afaf09343119f36798af6ebf8.poster.avif?t=1787966924\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Story Header\" width=616 height=56 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join Amalia as she searches for her friend in a land afflicted by a noxious fog. The deeper she ventures, the further she unravels a force that threatens far more than just one life.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/04461c8a25ce6d8a82da5d2714a21c51.poster.avif?t=1787966924\" aria-label=\"battling on a train\" width=780 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/04461c8a25ce6d8a82da5d2714a21c51.webm?t=1787966924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/04461c8a25ce6d8a82da5d2714a21c51.mp4?t=1787966924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/80de2dd7e44b460f7e8e2033d5ab141f.poster.avif?t=1787966924\" aria-label=\"Features Header\" width=616 