 fall.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Combine skills</strong> to create devastating combos.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/214fd325f442a50e229d2871e961c97a.poster.avif?t=1787966924\" aria-label=\"traveling through a desert\" width=780 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/214fd325f442a50e229d2871e961c97a.webm?t=1787966924\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/214fd325f442a50e229d2871e961c97a.mp4?t=1787966924\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A focus on fun</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>15–25 hour story</strong> focused on grounded relationships in a deadly fog-plagued world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gameplay variety</strong>: minigames, puzzles, and quests; performance affects difficulty.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Encouraged item usage</strong>; refill empty bottles in towns instead of hoarding.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/ca785acff4e7107ad322d879cff6938e.apng?t=1787966924\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3101780/extras/ca785acff4e7107ad322d879cff6938e.poster.avif?t=1787966924\" class=\"bb_img\" alt=\"Team Header\" width=616 height=56 /></picture></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This project was built over 20 years through multiple engines, story rewrites, and with the help of a patient, supportive community.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>zexyu</strong> - Stor